  <trk>
    <name>Waterside in Irvine to Eglinton</name>
    <desc>Walk from Waterside, Irvine, following the Ayrshire coastal path route into Kilwinning and through Eglinton country park to return to Irvine via Bank Street, passing Seagate castle.</desc>
